Text transformations over the textkit core. Results go to stdout, or to a file with --out.

Usage:
  {{project-name}} text [command]

Available Commands:
  slugify     Convert text to a lowercase hyphenated slug
  truncate    Shorten text to at most --max characters

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for text

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would happen without writing anything
      --format string   output format: plain or json (default "plain")
      --json            shorthand for --format json
      --no-color        disable color in diagnostics (NO_COLOR is also honoured)
      --no-input        never prompt; fail instead of asking
      --quiet           suppress diagnostics
      --verbose         print diagnostics about what the command is doing

Use "{{project-name}} text [command] --help" for more information about a command.
